@*  INJ-003 WO Confirm user manual. *@

<div class="help-doc">
    <div>
        <div class="help-h1">INJ-003 · WO CONFIRM</div>
        <div class="help-sub">작업 지시 확인 — 라인 배정된 WO 목록에서 작업 시작</div>

        <svg class="help-svg" viewBox="0 0 720 480" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <rect x="6" y="6" width="708" height="468" rx="10" fill="#000" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.18)" stroke-width="1.5" />
            <rect class="hs-region tbar" x="14" y="14" width="692" height="42" />
            <text class="hs-sub" x="34" y="40">INJ-003 · STATION · LINE</text>

            @* ① WO list *@
            <rect class="hs-region" x="14" y="68" width="692" height="280" />
            <text class="hs-sub" x="28" y="88">▼ WORK ORDERS · 배정 WO</text>
            @for (var i = 0; i < 3; i++)
            {
                var y = 100 + i * 76;
                var cls = i == 0 ? "ok" : "";
                <g>
                    <rect class="hs-region @cls" x="28" y="@y" width="664" height="64" />
                    <text class="hs-label" x="42" y="@(y+22)" style="font-size:14px;">WO-2026-0529-00@(i+1)</text>
                    <text class="hs-sub" x="42" y="@(y+42)">DOOR TRIM LH · 384 EA · D-2</text>
                    <text class="hs-sub" x="678" y="@(y+22)" text-anchor="end">@(i == 0 ? "ACTIVE" : "PENDING")</text>
                </g>
            }
            <circle class="hs-num" cx="24" cy="78" r="14" />
            <text class="hs-num-tx" x="24" y="78">1</text>

            @* ② Action buttons *@
            <rect class="hs-region ok"  x="14" y="362" width="340" height="56" />
            <text class="hs-label" x="184" y="396" text-anchor="middle" style="font-size:18px;">✓ START / RESUME</text>

            <rect class="hs-region warn" x="368" y="362" width="338" height="56" />
            <text class="hs-label" x="537" y="396" text-anchor="middle" style="font-size:18px;">✗ REJECT WO</text>
            <circle class="hs-num" cx="24" cy="372" r="14" />
            <text class="hs-num-tx" x="24" y="372">2</text>

            @* ③ Nav *@
            <rect class="hs-region nav" x="14" y="432" width="692" height="32" />
            <text class="hs-sub" x="360" y="450" text-anchor="middle">▶ INJ-002 · 04 · 05 · ... · LOGOUT</text>
            <circle class="hs-num" cx="24" cy="442" r="13" />
            <text class="hs-num-tx" x="24" y="442">3</text>
        </svg>
    </div>

    <div>
        <div class="help-section-h">▶ <span class="h-sec-en">READ THE SCREEN</span><span class="h-sec-ko">화면 읽기</span></div>
        <div class="help-steps">
            <div class="help-step ok">
                <div class="help-step-num">1</div>
                <div class="help-step-body">
                    <div class="help-step-en">WO list for your line. ACTIVE = currently selected. PENDING = waiting. Each card shows WO no, item, qty, D-Day.</div>
                    <div class="help-step-ko">라인에 배정된 WO 목록. ACTIVE = 현재 선택, PENDING = 대기. WO 번호 · 아이템 · 수량 · D-Day 표시.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="help-step warn">
                <div class="help-step-num">2</div>
                <div class="help-step-body">
                    <div class="help-step-en"><strong>START / RESUME</strong> picks a WO and arms the line. <strong>REJECT</strong> records why and sends it back to PP.</div>
                    <div class="help-step-ko"><strong>시작/재개</strong>: 선택한 WO 활성화. <strong>거부</strong>: 사유 입력 후 PP로 반려.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="help-step dim">
                <div class="help-step-num">3</div>
                <div class="help-step-body">
                    <div class="help-step-en">Bottom nav to the other INJ screens.</div>
                    <div class="help-step-ko">하단 내비게이션.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="help-section-h">▶ <span class="h-sec-en">COMMON TASKS</span><span class="h-sec-ko">자주 쓰는 작업</span></div>
        <div class="help-steps">
            <div class="help-step">
                <div class="help-step-num">A</div>
                <div class="help-step-body">
                    <div class="help-step-en"><strong>Start a new WO</strong> — tap row → <kbd>START</kbd> → INJ-002 auto-loads.</div>
                    <div class="help-step-ko"><strong>WO 시작</strong> — 행 선택 → 시작 → INJ-002 자동 진입.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="help-step bad">
                <div class="help-step-num">B</div>
                <div class="help-step-body">
                    <div class="help-step-en"><strong>Wrong mold or material</strong> — REJECT with reason. PP supervisor resolves.</div>
                    <div class="help-step-ko"><strong>잘못된 금형/자재</strong> — 사유 입력 후 REJECT. PP 반장 처리.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
